2. Meshtastic protobufs (meshtastic/protobufs), GPL-3.0
   https://github.com/meshtastic/protobufs
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Shared/MeshtasticCore/ implements the Meshtastic BLE client protocol. No
generated code and no .proto files are included: the protobuf encoder/decoder
(ProtobufWire.swift, MeshtasticMessages.swift) is hand-written from the field
numbers and types in the .proto definitions. Because it is derived from those
GPL-3.0 definitions, it is distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later like the rest of
this project. Meshtastic(R) is a registered trademark of Meshtastic LLC; this
project is not affiliated with or endorsed by it.

