3. MeshCore (meshcore-dev/MeshCore), MIT License
   https://github.com/meshcore-dev/MeshCore
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Shared/MeshCoreCore/ implements the MeshCore companion-radio BLE protocol
(frame/command codes) as documented and implemented by MeshCore. No MeshCore
source code is included.

